    <section class="settings-layout"><aside class="surface settings-nav"><div class="settings-account"><span class="avatar large">林</span><span><strong>{{ state.user?.name || '林远' }}</strong><small>{{ state.user?.role || '管理员' }}</small></span></div><button :class="{ active: section === 'connection' }" @click="section = 'connection'"><Network :size="16"/> MQTT 接入<ChevronRight :size="14"/></button><button :class="{ active: section === 'security' }" @click="section = 'security'"><ShieldCheck :size="16"/> 安全与凭据<ChevronRight :size="14"/></button><button :class="{ active: section === 'account' }" @click="section = 'account'"><CircleUserRound :size="16"/> 用户信息<ChevronRight :size="14"/></button><button :class="{ active: section === 'about' }" @click="section = 'about'"><SlidersHorizontal :size="16"/> 平台信息<ChevronRight :size="14"/></button></aside>
      <section class="surface settings-content" v-if="section === 'connection'"><header class="settings-section-heading"><div><div class="section-kicker">消息接入</div><h2>MQTT Broker</h2><p>平台通过 MQTT 接收设备状态与遥测，并下发目标状态命令。</p></div><span class="connection-large" :class="state.mqtt.connected ? 'connected' : 'disconnected'"><i></i>{{ state.mqtt.connected ? '连接正常' : '连接中断' }}</span></header><div class="settings-status-banner" :class="state.mqtt.connected ? 'ok' : 'danger'"><span class="banner-icon"><CircleCheck v-if="state.mqtt.connected" :size="18"/><Wifi v-else :size="18"/></span><div><strong>{{ state.mqtt.connected ? 'Broker 连接正常' : 'Broker 当前不可达' }}</strong><span>最近检查：{{ new Date(state.mqtt.lastCheck).toLocaleString('zh-CN') }} · 局域网连接</span></div><button class="secondary-button small-button" @click="checkConnection"><RefreshCw :size="14"/> 重新检查</button></div><div class="settings-form"><div class="settings-form-heading"><Server :size="18"/><div><h3>连接参数</h3><p>修改后保存，平台重连时会使用新的参数。</p></div></div><div class="form-grid"><label class="form-field"><span>Broker 地址</span><input v-model="host" class="form-control" placeholder="192.168.1.20"/></label><label class="form-field"><span>端口</span><input v-model.number="port" type="number" class="form-control" min="1" max="65535"/></label><label class="form-field full"><span>平台客户端 ID</span><input v-model="clientId" class="form-control"/></label></div><div class="settings-form-footer"><span><Wifi :size="14"/> 当前仅允许家庭局域网访问</span><button class="primary-button" @click="saveConnection"><Save :size="16"/> {{ saved ? '已保存' : '保存连接配置' }}</button></div></div><section class="topic-contract"><div class="settings-form-heading"><Database :size="18"/><div><h3>主题约定</h3><p>设备身份、遥测与控制主题隔离。</p></div></div><div class="topic-setting-row"><span><strong>遥测 / 状态</strong><small>设备上报当前状态与属性数据</small></span><code>openiot/{deviceCode}/telemetry</code><button class="icon-button" aria-label="复制遥测主题" @click="navigator.clipboard?.writeText('openiot/{deviceCode}/telemetry')"><Copy :size="15"/></button></div><div class="topic-setting-row"><span><strong>控制命令</strong><small>平台下发目标状态，QoS 1</small></span><code>openiot/{deviceCode}/command</code><button class="icon-button" aria-label="复制控制主题" @click="navigator.clipboard?.writeText('openiot/{deviceCode}/command')"><Copy :size="15"/></button></div></section></section>
      <section class="surface settings-content" v-else-if="section === 'security'"><header class="settings-section-heading"><div><div class="section-kicker">安全基线</div><h2>安全与凭据</h2><p>首期按设备身份隔离访问范围，为后续真实 Broker 鉴权保留配置入口。</p></div></header><div class="security-check-list"><div><span class="security-check"><Check :size="16"/></span><span><strong>设备使用独立身份凭据</strong><small>每台设备拥有独立密钥，可在设备详情中查看和轮换。</small></span><span class="security-state">已配置</span></div><div><span class="security-check"><Check :size="16"/></span><span><strong>控制主题与遥测主题分离</strong><small>设备只访问自己的主题，不订阅其他设备数据。</small></span><span class="security-state">已配置</span></div><div><span class="security-check warning"><KeyRound :size="16"/></span><span><strong>Broker 用户认证</strong><small>当前为本地演示模式，连接参数已保存，真实凭据由后端服务托管。</small></span><span class="security-state warning">待后端接入</span></div><div><span class="security-check warning"><ShieldCheck :size="16"/></span><span><strong>TLS 加密</strong><small>家庭局域网 MVP 暂不启用公网访问，确认硬件与 Broker 后配置。</small></span><span class="security-state warning">后续配置</span></div></div><div class="security-callout"><ShieldCheck :size="18"/><span><strong>本地网络不等于可信网络</strong><small>部署到家庭主机时，请保持管理 API 与 Broker 的认证，不要直接暴露公网端口。</small></span></div></section>
      <section class="surface settings-content" v-else-if="section === 'account'"><header class="settings-section-heading"><div><div class="section-kicker">账户</div><h2>用户信息</h2><p>当前平台账户与基础角色权限。</p></div></header><div class="profile-card"><span class="avatar xl">林</span><div><h3>{{ state.user?.name || '林远' }}</h3><p>{{ state.user?.email || 'lin.yuan@example.com' }}</p><span class="role-chip"><ShieldCheck :size="13"/> 管理员</span></div><button class="secondary-button"><Edit3 :size="15"/> 编辑信息</button></div><div class="permission-list"><h3>当前权限</h3><div><Check :size="15"/> 查看设备与实时数据</div><div><Check :size="15"/> 控制在线设备与查看命令结果</div><div><Check :size="15"/> 配置产品属性和告警规则</div><div><Check :size="15"/> 管理本地接入与设备凭据</div></div></section>
